{"page":557,"verses":[{"verse_key":"64:10","surah":64,"ayah":10,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ وَكَذَّبُوا۟ بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَآ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ أَصْحَـٰبُ ٱلنَّارِ خَـٰلِدِينَ فِيهَا ۖ وَبِئْسَ ٱلْمَصِيرُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But those who disbelieved and rejected Our signs will be the inhabitants of the Fire, there to remain- a miserable destination.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"But those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"64:10"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieved","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"64:10"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَكَذَّبُوا۟","en_gloss":"and denied","transliteration":"wakadhabū","verse_key":"64:10"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَآ","en_gloss":"[in] Our Verses","transliteration":"biāyātinā","verse_key":"64:10"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"those","transliteration":"ulāika","verse_key":"64:10"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَصْحَـٰبُ","en_gloss":"(are the) companions","transliteration":"aṣḥābu","verse_key":"64:10"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلنَّارِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Fire","transliteration":"l-nāri","verse_key":"64:10"},{"pos":8,"ar":"خَـٰلِدِينَ","en_gloss":"abiding forever","transliteration":"khālidīna","verse_key":"64:10"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فِيهَا ۖ","en_gloss":"therein","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"64:10"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَبِئْسَ","en_gloss":"And wretched is","transliteration":"wabi'sa","verse_key":"64:10"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْمَصِيرُ","en_gloss":"the destination","transliteration":"l-maṣīru","verse_key":"64:10"},{"pos":12,"ar":"١٠","en_gloss":"(10)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"64:10"}]},{"verse_key":"64:11","surah":64,"ayah":11,"ar_uthmani":"مَآ أَصَابَ مِن مُّصِيبَةٍ إِلَّا بِإِذْنِ ٱللَّهِ ۗ وَمَن يُؤْمِنۢ بِٱللَّهِ يَهْدِ قَلْبَهُۥ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ بِكُلِّ شَىْءٍ عَلِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Misfortunes can only happen with God’s permission––He will guide the heart of anyone who believes in Him: God knows all things––","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"مَآ","en_gloss":"Not","translit